    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u221e\u00a0<strong>About OpenDraft </strong>\u221e</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>OpenDraft</strong>\u00a0was developed with the goal of improving work-flow, and built for anyone who needed a distraction-free environment to brainstorm, write, or doodle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed with simplicity and versatility in mind, it boasts an infinitely growing canvas, infinite text boxes, a customizable pencil, and multiple nature sound tracks for you to choose from and help you focus!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're drafting a story or novel, writing or sketching strategies for games, organizing your study notes, brainstorming ideas, developing a game or program, or just want relaxing background audio, OpenDraft provides you with the tools you need. It gives you the freedom and space to do it all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u221e\u00a0<strong>Infinite Canvas</strong>: Draw and write without boundaries, with space that grows as you do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u221e\u00a0<strong>Offline &amp; Secure</strong>: Everything is stored locally on your device - work without an internet connection, and access your save files at any time!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u221e\u00a0<strong>Sketching</strong>: Customize your sketches and doodles with a customizable pencil tool!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u221e\u00a0<strong>Rich Text  Editing</strong>: Customize your writing  with adjustable fonts using Rich Text Editing. E.g <i>italics</i>, <strong>bold</strong>, <span class=\"bb_strike\">strike</span>, etc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u221e\u00a0<strong>Ambient Soundtracks</strong>: Stay focused with relaxing background soundscapes while you work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u221e\u00a0<strong>Auto/Manual Save</strong>: Never lose progress - your work is automatically saved every five minutes, and you can manually save at any time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u221e\u00a0<strong>Paste Images From Clipboard:</strong> Paste any image in your clipboard onto the canvas right where your mouse is. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u221e\u00a0<strong>And not much more!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you want a clean and minimalist experience, you value simplicity, privacy, and creativity without the clutter, OpenDraft allows you to focus on your ideas, regardless of what you are working on.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u221e\u00a0<strong>About OpenDraft </strong>\u221e</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>OpenDraft</strong>\u00a0was developed with the goal of improving work-flow, and built for anyone who needed a distraction-free environment to brainstorm, write, or doodle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed with simplicity and versatility in mind, it boasts an infinitely growing canvas, infinite text boxes, a customizable pencil, and multiple nature sound tracks for you to choose from and help you focus!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're drafting a story or novel, writing or sketching strategies for games, organizing your study notes, brainstorming ideas, developing a game or program, or just want relaxing background audio, OpenDraft provides you with the tools you need. It gives you the freedom and space to do it all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u221e\u00a0<strong>Infinite Canvas</strong>: Draw and write without boundaries, with space that grows as you do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u221e\u00a0<strong>Offline &amp; Secure</strong>: Everything is stored locally on your device - work without an internet connection, and access your save files at any time!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u221e\u00a0<strong>Sketching</strong>: Customize your sketches and doodles with a customizable pencil tool!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u221e\u00a0<strong>Rich Text  Editing</strong>: Customize your writing  with adjustable fonts using Rich Text Editing. E.g <i>italics</i>, <strong>bold</strong>, <span class=\"bb_strike\">strike</span>, etc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u221e\u00a0<strong>Ambient Soundtracks</strong>: Stay focused with relaxing background soundscapes while you work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u221e\u00a0<strong>Auto/Manual Save</strong>: Never lose progress - your work is automatically saved every five minutes, and you can manually save at any time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u221e\u00a0<strong>Paste Images From Clipboard:</strong> Paste any image in your clipboard onto the canvas right where your mouse is. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u221e\u00a0<strong>And not much more!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you want a clean and minimalist experience, you value simplicity, privacy, and creativity without the clutter, OpenDraft allows you to focus on your ideas, regardless of what you are working on.</p>",
